\begin{itemize}
\item \emph{Manipulating emotions:} 
    - Bullies typically target vulnerable individuals through intimidation and coercion 
- Bullies may provoke fear, intimidate, and threaten 
- Bullies may employ humiliation and put individuals in bad public standing with peers in order to intimidate victims from coming forward for help.
\end{itemize}
\begin{itemize}
